      <Comment source="PMN, hawkins, SRI, caspi">This compound was identified as bactericidal to replicating cells of |FRAME: TAX-1773| |CITS: [27623055]|. The target of the compound was identified as |FRAME: EC-1.1.98.3| (|FRAME: G185E-8086 DprE1|), an essential enzyme involved in arabinogalactan synthesis |CITS: [27432954]|. Some mycobacterial strains are able to inactivate it by &lt;i&gt;N&lt;/i&gt;-methylation carried out by |FRAME: EC-2.1.1.374| |CITS: [27432954]|.</Comment>
